  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60224dfd1ee765db",
      "translationZh": "我测试了从 huggingface 按下载量排序选取的 11 个无审查版 Gemma 4 12B 变体。将 10 个完整的拒绝机制消融版本，加上应要求纳入比较的 2 个 LoRA 适配器，与官方基础模型进行了对比。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fafece19ff600b87",
      "translationZh": "在一张 5090 上，历时三周半，耗费 165 个 GPU 小时。进行了权重取证分析、KL 散度分析、13 项基准测试任务，以及包含 400 种行为的 HarmBench 测试。每条回答都由 LLM 评审读取完整推理轨迹后进行评审；总计 6,800 条回答，得到 6,000 次评审判定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20aa89aa07a6ac76",
      "translationZh": "完整报告位于 Abliterlitics Gemma4-12b，同一份报告也发布在 HuggingFace DreamFast/Gemma4-12b-it-abliterlitics 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fed12271eade93ac",
      "translationZh": "我们新增了一项功能，你可以在 Abliterlitics Harmbench Gemma4-12b 浏览每个模型的 HarmBench 回答及推理过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "245cdc4d6ea55722",
      "translationZh": "评审判定的攻击成功率（ASR），从最好到最差排列，每个附一句点评：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5140479a9c87cd0c",
      "translationZh": "huihui 89.8%，越狱程度最高，改动最精准。代价是：TQA -14.3 个百分点，GPQA -8.1 个百分点，而且 24% 的 GSM8K 尝试会陷入循环。如果你能接受这些代价，它能提供最大程度的解锁。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "548583c6cdc24f36",
      "translationZh": "trevorjs 85.8%，总体权衡最优，各项表现都接近基础模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6001e288be86f108",
      "translationZh": "coder3101 81.0%，在整个比较中 GSM8K 表现最好，超过基础模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c504a519bf163a0",
      "translationZh": "sdft LoRAs 79.5%，与排名前4的拒绝消融版本持平，能力完全保留。SDFT 作者在报告中分享了他制作 LoRAs 的一些心得。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96f14c19767bea85",
      "translationZh": "jwest33 78.0%，新的零空间工具，保留了能力，但使推理变得不稳定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8235951645e057af",
      "translationZh": "llmfan Heretic ARA 76.3%，16 个张量，GSM8K 作答率 +1.9pp。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "405ca38ce9ca9999",
      "translationZh": "prithiv 72.5%，非 LoRA 版本中 KL 最低，独立运行的结果干净。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec6040ffebdcfca2",
      "translationZh": "abliterix 68.8%，能力几乎完好无损，解锁程度处于中游。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ee94867fa21b1bd",
      "translationZh": "openyourmind 67.0%，在 12B 规模上应避免使用，MMLU-Pro -22.4pp；作者表示，该方法面向更大的模型，这次只是一次测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2211380c7e023f7",
      "translationZh": "obliteratus 60.8%，应避免使用，会损伤能力回路。受损严重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fabf1dc46917070",
      "translationZh": "apostate 45.8%，选择性最强，保留了 82% 的化学/生物相关拒答，使用较旧的 Apostate 版本制作。较新版本的效果会更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8283720cb4da23d",
      "translationZh": "base 为 21.0%，主要是受版权保护内容的复现，直接伤害方面接近零",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c1d2915bd1e535e",
      "translationZh": "13 个模型的数据量太大，reddit 放不下，所以这里挑出有意思的部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8ed958d7857ce7a",
      "translationZh": "这是迄今为止最难攻破的模型。这是我第一次看到，并非所有模型的 Harmbench ASR 都能达到或超过 90%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59df65ddb86bb6d5",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 4 12B 是一个思考模型，而总分把它一直兜圈子思考、直到耗尽 token 预算的题目也全都算了进去。huihui 的总分是 66.9%，看起来像是损失了 15 个百分点。如果只对完成了思考的尝试计分，它就能达到 88.0%，与 base 相差不超过 0.7 个百分点。能力从未消失，消失的是推理稳定性。空响应率从 coder3101 的 6.9%（优于 base）到 openyourmind 的 38% 不等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bfdf35220a377f4",
      "translationZh": "最精准的修改再次胜出，但有个问题。huihui 改动了 12 个张量，占模型的 1.8%，并取得了最高的 ASR。obliteratus 修改了 144 个张量，openyourmind 修改了 620 个，但两者消除拒绝行为的效果都更差。不过，权重层面的精准修改并不意味着在基准测试上没有副作用：在这次比较中，huihui 的 TQA 降幅也是最大的。就解锁力度而言，修改位置比修改幅度更重要，但附带损伤并非如此。如果你想要解锁却不想要损伤，那就选 trevorjs 或 prithiv。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab3c7646143b903d",
      "translationZh": "大家都在用的正则表达式分类器，在统计思考模型时，误差最高可达 13 个百分点。按关键词匹配，huihui 排第 3；按评判模型判定，它排第 1。它那些使用改述表达、包含大量思考的配合回答，会直接漏过关键词检测。这篇帖子中的所有数字，都是 GLM 5.2 评判模型基于完整推理轨迹给出的判定结果，而这 6,800 条响应中的每一条，都可以在下方链接的浏览器中查看。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9f424cd7c6502e1",
      "translationZh": "base 的 ASR 为 21.0%，但这主要来自那 100 道版权问题，该类别的 ASR 为 56%。在直接伤害类别上，它接近零。真正拉开差距的是化学/生物和网络犯罪。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8468d65e94256ac1",
      "translationZh": "在 12B 规模上，应避免使用 openyourmind。MMLU-Pro 下降了 22.4 个百分点，而且 38% 的 GSM8K 尝试始终未能完成思考。作者说，这个方法面向更大的模型，这次只是试运行，而这些数字也印证了他的说法。obliteratus 也应避免使用：它在影响拒绝行为的同时，也损伤了能力回路，在这次比较中，每单位解锁效果所付出的能力损伤代价最高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e5e3f50f044b582",
      "translationZh": "完整报告：abliterlitics.dev/models/gemma4-12b",
      "provider": "local",
      "model": "reference-labels-v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbbbda008ecdfecb",
      "translationZh": "每条回复、推理轨迹和评判结果均可浏览：abliterlitics.dev/harmbench/gemma4-12b",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "875050f67cc8338c",
      "translationZh": "代码：github.com/dreamfast/abliterlitics",
      "provider": "local",
      "model": "reference-labels-v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74a15c1a5e2e438d",
      "translationZh": "有几个人问起了 Qwen 3.8 27b，所以下一个就做它。想指定一个模型？想吐槽我选的基准测试？来我们的 Discord 聊天区告诉我们吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2775acdaefab8ee6",
      "translationZh": "模型 ASR GSM8K KL 张量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "580e3d60a1d385a5",
      "translationZh": "ASR 由大语言模型评判，涵盖 HarmBench 的 400 种行为。GSM8K 是仅对已作答题目计算的准确率。KL = 相对于基础模型的输出分布偏移，越低越干净。张量 = 被修改的权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bd97ea6a0fa62ff",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/nathandreamfast 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
